msgid ""
"<b>Figure %1$i.</b> Scatter plot of the book values in the selection and "
"their audit values. Red dots indicate observations that did not match their "
"original book value. If these red dots lie in the bottom part of the graph, "
"the book values are overstated. If these red dots lie in the upper part of "
"the graph, they are understated. The value <i>r</i> is the Pearson "
"correlation coefficient of the book values and the audit values, an "
"indicator of the strength of the linear relationship between the two "
"variables."
msgstr ""
"<b>図 %1$i.</b> 抽出された標本の簿価と、その監査値の散布図です。赤い点は、も"
"との簿価と一致しなかった観測値を表します。赤い点が図の下側にあれば簿価は過大"
"計上、上側にあれば過小計上です。 <i>r</i> は簿価と監査値のピアソンの相関係数"
"であり、2つの変数の線形関係の強さを表します。"

